{% liquid
assign form_id = 'FibselectInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign machine_names = 'LZ-1530F Fiber Laser Cutting Machine' | split: ','
assign machine = all_products['1530-fiber-laser-cutting-machine']
%}<div class="dd-fibselect"><section class="dd-fibselect__hero"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap"><nav class="dd-fibselect__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Fiber Laser Cutting Machines</span></nav><div class="dd-fibselect__split"><div><p class="dd-fibselect__eyebrow">PLAN AROUND YOUR METAL &amp; PRODUCTION NEEDS</p><h1>Fiber Laser Cutting Machines for Sheet Metal</h1><p class="dd-fibselect__lead">Explore the LZ-1530F for shaped metal parts, signage and decorative panels. Select the power and configuration around your metal grade, thickness and required finish.</p><div class="dd-fibselect__actions"><a class="dd-fibselect__button" href="{{ machine.url }}">View LZ-1530F</a><a href="#FibselectContact">Get Equipment Advice →</a></div><p class="dd-fibselect__note">Configuration advice · Free sample testing · Training &amp; technical support</p></div><figure>{{ machine.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '400,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: 'LZ-1530F fiber laser cutting machine for sheet metal' }}<figcaption>LZ-1530F. Final equipment configuration is confirmed in your quotation.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-fibselect__section"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap"><h2>What do you want to produce?</h2><div class="dd-fibselect__grid"><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>Sheet-metal components</h3><p>Plan shaped parts and cut profiles around your drawings, sheet specification and downstream fabrication process.</p></article><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>Metal signs & lettering</h3><p>Evaluate metal lettering and sign components. Confirm the edge finish and any subsequent finishing or assembly.</p></article><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>Decorative panels & metal crafts</h3><p>Review cut-out patterns, narrow features and part handling with your artwork and material before choosing equipment.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-fibselect__section dd-fibselect__tint"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap dd-fibselect__split"><div><p class="dd-fibselect__eyebrow">FEATURED MODEL</p><h2>LZ-1530F: choose the configuration around the job</h2><p>Review 1.5kW, 3kW and 6kW power options together with the material and production target. The proposal should also define the laser source, cutting head, chiller, assist gas and electrical requirements.</p><p>Send your usual thickness range and the most demanding part you expect to make. We can use sample testing to assess the required result before confirming the configuration.</p><a class="dd-fibselect__button" href="{{ machine.url }}">View Specifications &amp; Get a Quote</a></div><figure><div class="fiber-sample-window"><img src="{{ 'fiber-decorative-metal-panel.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' }}" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" alt="Decorative metal panel with floral and leaf cutout patterns" class="fiber-original-samples"></div><figcaption>Decorative metal panel with floral cutout patterns. Material, thickness and cutting results are confirmed through sample testing.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="dd-fibselect__section"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap"><h2>Four details for a useful equipment proposal</h2><div class="dd-fibselect__two"><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>01 · Metal grade & surface</h3><p>Specify the exact material grade, any coating and the finish you require.</p></article><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>02 · Thickness & sheet size</h3><p>List the thickness range you use regularly and the largest sheet and part dimensions.</p></article><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>03 · Drawings & output target</h3><p>Send representative drawings, quantities and the required production schedule.</p></article><article class="dd-fibselect__panel"><h3>04 · Workshop & utilities</h3><p>Share your power supply, available gas arrangements, installation space and destination.</p></article></div><p class="dd-fibselect__note">Cutting thickness, speed and finish must be evaluated for the proposed setup. Power alone is not a guarantee of production performance.</p><a class="dd-fibselect__button" href="#FibselectContact">Request a Free Sample Test</a></div></section>
<section class="dd-fibselect__section dd-fibselect__tint"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap dd-fibselect__split"><div><h2>Connect cutting with your production workflow</h2><p>For metal sign projects, review cutting alongside the other equipment and processes needed for a finished product.</p><p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-sign">Explore Signage Production →</a></p><p>When your parts also need joining, discuss the material and joint requirements for <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-f-3-in-1-handheld-laser-welding-machine">handheld laser welding</a>.</p><p>Configuration, accessories, training and delivery arrangements are confirmed for each order.</p></div><div class="dd-fibselect__faq"><h2>Fiber Laser Cutting Questions</h2><details><summary>How do I choose the laser power?</summary><p>Start with the metal grade, thickness range, part geometry and required output. Review the 1.5kW, 3kW and 6kW options against a sample test and a configuration proposal rather than power alone.</p></details><details><summary>What thickness can the machine cut?</summary><p>The result depends on power, metal grade, assist gas, cutting setup and required edge quality. Send your actual material and thickness range for testing; a single maximum-thickness figure does not describe every production job.</p></details><details><summary>What configuration details should be confirmed?</summary><p>Confirm the laser source, cutting head, chiller, assist gas arrangements, electrical requirements and supplied accessories in the quotation. Share the available utilities and workshop layout during planning.</p></details><details><summary>Can I send drawings for a free sample test?</summary><p>Yes. Send the metal specification, thickness, drawings, part dimensions and required finish. We will agree sample testing arrangements with you. Any sample shipping is agreed separately.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide installation training and technical support?</summary><p>English manuals and videos, remote installation training, equipment-specific spare parts and technical support are available. On-site support can be arranged. Delivery timing is agreed for each order.</p></details></div></div></section>
{% if collection.products_count > 1 %}<section class="dd-fibselect__section"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap"><h2>More Fiber Laser Cutting Machines</h2>{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}<div class="dd-fibselect__grid">{% for item in collection.products %}{% unless item.handle == '1530-fiber-laser-cutting-machine' %}<article class="dd-fibselect__card"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: item.featured_image.alt }}<div class="dd-fibselect__body"><h3>{{ item.title | escape }}</h3><span>View Machine →</span></div></a></article>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</div>{{ paginate | default_pagination }}{% endpaginate %}</div></section>{% endif %}
  <section class="dd-fibselect__section" id="FibselectContact"><div class="dd-fibselect__wrap dd-fibselect__split"><div><p class="dd-fibselect__eyebrow">TELL US WHAT YOU WANT TO MAKE</p><h2>Get an equipment proposal for your sheet-metal cutting application</h2><p>Share your material, thickness, finished size and production requirements. We will help you plan the equipment and a free sample test.</p><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p><p class="dd-fibselect__note">Need to share artwork or photos? Send them by email or WhatsApp. Name, email and message are required.</p></div>
    {% form 'contact', id: form_id %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source]" value="Fiber laser cutting category">
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="dd-fibselect__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-fibselect-success><strong>Thank you — your inquiry has been sent.</strong><p>Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email. You do not need to submit the same inquiry again.</p></div><dialog data-fibselect-dialog aria-labelledby="FibselectSuccessTitle"><h2 id="FibselectSuccessTitle">Inquiry sent successfully</h2><p>Thank you for contacting Dragon Diamond. Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email.</p><button type="button" class="dd-fibselect__button" data-fibselect-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="dd-fibselect__fields"><div><label for="FibselectName-{{ section.id }}">Name *</label><input id="FibselectName-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="FibselectEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email *</label><input id="FibselectEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="FibselectCompany-{{ section.id }}">Company</label><input id="FibselectCompany-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization" value="{{ form.Company | escape }}"></div><div><label for="FibselectWA-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp</label><input id="FibselectWA-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="{{ form.WhatsApp | escape }}"></div></div>
      <label for="FibselectProduct-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested</label><select id="FibselectProduct-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]"><option>Fiber laser cutting / need advice</option>{% for name in machine_names %}<option>{{ name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option>Other metal cutting requirements</option></select>
      <label for="FibselectMessage-{{ section.id }}">Message *</label><textarea id="FibselectMessage-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Metal grade, thickness range, sheet size, drawings, output target and destination country..." required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button type="submit" class="dd-fibselect__button">Send Inquiry</button>
    {% endform %}
  </div></section></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","@id":{{ canonical_url | append: '#collection' | json }},"url":{{ canonical_url | json }},"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"description":{{ collection.description | strip_html | json }}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | append: routes.root_url | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>{% stylesheet %}
